# Real information about a live Splunk estate. None of this belongs in a
# repository - see "What is deliberately not in this repository" in README.md.

# Your stack names, SSM parameter paths, and possibly a plain-text token.
# config.example.json is the committed template.
config.json

# Snapshots: every username on both stacks, their roles, and your index, app and
# SAML group names. One fetch.py run creates all of it.
data/
_offline_test/data/

# Excel reports and rollback journals - per-user by definition.
results/
_offline_test/results/
*.xlsx
*.jsonl

